ype":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒ブリ美味しかった??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鱒のすしも有名なんだけど食べてった＼(^o^)／?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白えびは食べれましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって魚介類が苦手って言ってたけどお寿司の中で何が好きなの!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒ブリ美味しかった(^^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鱒と白えびは食べてないです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ富山のお寿司屋さんエピソード書こうかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動のロケバスの中で、「何のお寿司が好きー?」って話になったんよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんちっちゃい頃は極度のお魚さん嫌いで、お刺身も食べなかったからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちっちゃい頃はたまごばっかり食べてたよ←」って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ今は結構食べれるようになりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん(白石麻衣chan)は「サーモンが好き!」って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問てコメントに書けばいいの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーんです(ω)◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘えん坊のひめたんはメンバーの中で1番誰に甘えてるカナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番なんて決められないけれどもー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ(衛藤美彩chan)、みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)とかのしっかりしたお姉さんかな(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、心理テスト好きかな?真相心理って興味ある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい結果だけ信じる人です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざ☆ぷらす思考!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早口言葉言えるようになった?ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炙りカルビ炙りカルビ炙りカルビ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(`・ω・')どやあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...はい言えません。練習しておくね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香のこれからの目標やしたい事を教えてほしい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的な目標としては、やっぱり歌やダンスもビジュアルも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと磨いていかなきゃ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したい事はーなんだろう。もっとイベントで地方をまわりたい(ω)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かオススメのマンガとかありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんあんまりマンガ読まないんよね('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女マンガにはまりたい時期もあったりしたけれども☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かオススメのマンガあれば教えてください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、自分がやるとしたらどんな髪型が好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフアップ好きかなっ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは雪合戦とかするのは好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪合戦は見てるだけで満足∩^ω^∩★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いから雪に触ろうとは思わないの。当てられるのも当たるのも冷たいじゃん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも「きゃー!」って言いながらはしゃいでるみんなの幸せそうな顔をみるのは好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ちゃんの嫌いな物ってなに?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手なものありますか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また苦手だけど克服したいもの、たぶん無理そうなものなどありましたら教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手はものは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼いたお魚、煮たお魚、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走ること投げること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛ぶこと泳ぐこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学、理科、あと寒さ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお魚さんは克服しなきゃだよねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る。お魚さんのこと好きになるから(∀)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の季節がすきですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春(`・ω・')!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽかぽかしてるし、いろんなイベントがあるしお誕生日もあるし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は春から高校生だからいろんな出会いもあって楽しみなの!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声らぶたんににてるよね分かる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶたんさんもちろんわかりますよ(ω)♪可愛らしいですよね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとですかー?嬉しいっ☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/05/8188791/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きなお菓子は何カナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘ーいお菓子は大概好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ明治のミルチ好きですよお♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"}],"source":"archive"}